WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:04.977
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:05.247 --> 01:08.387
[Episode 1]

3
01:17.431 --> 01:20.640
My goodness, what a crowd!

4
01:20.640 --> 01:22.400
- Yes. - Gentlemen,

5
01:22.400 --> 01:25.040
Bao Zhu of the Jin's Butcher Shop

6
01:25.040 --> 01:26.480
is the most capable girl

7
01:26.480 --> 01:29.120
[Sai Jin Hua, Matchmaker of Lianhua Township] for miles around!

8
01:29.120 --> 01:30.239
Really?

9
01:30.239 --> 01:32.599
She is gorgeous,

10
01:32.599 --> 01:37.140
and best of all, gentle and caring.

11
01:54.159 --> 01:55.959
You have all seen it, haven't you?

12
01:55.959 --> 01:58.120
Look at her build, and her strength.

13
01:58.120 --> 02:00.812
She could easily pop out a dozen sons

14
02:00.812 --> 02:02.400
without breaking a sweat!

15
02:02.400 --> 02:04.400
Now that her father's mourning is done,

16
02:04.400 --> 02:06.840
her mother asked me to play matchmaker.

17
02:06.840 --> 02:09.199
That's how you lads got so lucky.

18
02:09.199 --> 02:12.879
She is considerate and doesn't want to waste anyone's time,

19
02:12.879 --> 02:14.199
so she had me

20
02:14.199 --> 02:16.479
gather you all here to size each other up.

21
02:16.479 --> 02:18.680
You'd all better impress today.

22
02:18.680 --> 02:22.120
Don't miss this fine match!

23
02:22.120 --> 02:23.780
- Me first! - Line up!

24
02:24.719 --> 02:26.340
Line up, all of you.

25
02:47.906 --> 02:51.628
[Jin Bao Zhu, Daughter of a Butcher]

26
02:53.840 --> 02:55.000
I sell vegetables.

27
02:55.000 --> 02:58.080
It's just me and my mother. No land.

28
02:58.080 --> 03:00.479
I make my living from calligraphy and paintings.

29
03:00.479 --> 03:02.439
My four older sisters live with me

30
03:02.439 --> 03:04.000
and take care of the household.

31
03:04.000 --> 03:06.280
Killing harms your karma and lacks decency.

32
03:06.280 --> 03:09.280
Miss Bao Zhu, I'm a blacksmith.

33
03:09.280 --> 03:10.400
I make decent money.

34
03:10.400 --> 03:12.280
You butcher pigs, and I forge iron.

35
03:12.280 --> 03:14.680
Together, we can conquer anything.

36
03:14.680 --> 03:17.159
The elderly have weak teeth and slow digestion.

37
03:17.159 --> 03:19.039
Once stewed, the layered pork belly

38
03:19.039 --> 03:20.599
won't stick in teeth.

39
03:20.599 --> 03:22.939
That's 57 wen and 6 fen.

40
03:23.879 --> 03:26.960
Pig's heart enriches blood, and liver sharpens vision.

41
03:26.960 --> 03:29.360
They're perfect for soup to boost qi and kidneys.

42
03:29.360 --> 03:31.800
That's 50 wen and 4 fen.

43
03:31.800 --> 03:32.800
No, no, no!

44
03:32.800 --> 03:34.800
You don't even care for your sisters.

45
03:34.800 --> 03:37.199
How can I expect you to care for your wife

46
03:37.199 --> 03:39.680
and teach her to read and write?

47
03:39.680 --> 03:41.719
This trotter is perfect for you.

48
03:41.719 --> 03:44.599
Blacksmithing ruins your hands. Eat what you want to heal!

49
03:44.599 --> 03:47.479
- That's 64 wen and 8 fen. - So pricey?

50
03:47.479 --> 03:49.479
If you're this stingy with yourself,

51
03:49.479 --> 03:51.460
how can you afford a beauty?

52
04:17.279 --> 04:19.399
Here I am talking up matches for you,

53
04:19.399 --> 04:22.759
and you're just bleeding them dry like pigs.

54
04:22.759 --> 04:26.079
If word gets out, you'll ruin my reputation.

55
04:26.079 --> 04:28.439
I appreciate your kindness, ma'am,

56
04:28.439 --> 04:30.279
but marriage is no joke.

57
04:30.279 --> 04:32.079
If I rush into a bad match,

58
04:32.079 --> 04:34.160
that would really ruin your reputation.

59
04:34.160 --> 04:36.319
Your mother's dying to get your bride price.

60
04:36.319 --> 04:37.879
If you stall any longer,

61
04:37.879 --> 04:40.399
she'll tie you up and marry you to a rich landlord.

62
04:40.399 --> 04:43.279
I'll marry. Of course, I will.

63
04:43.279 --> 04:45.839
But only to the best.

64
04:45.839 --> 04:48.637
I want him handsome,

65
04:48.637 --> 04:51.480
tall, healthy,

66
04:51.480 --> 04:54.959
well-off, and of noble character,

67
04:54.959 --> 04:57.480
a man who excels both indoors and out,

68
04:57.480 --> 04:59.519
handling both home and the world.

69
04:59.519 --> 05:01.480
[Xie Yan, Courtesy Name Cheng Jiang, Eldest Legitimate Son of the Xie Family]

70
05:01.480 --> 05:05.620
Master, this is the Huang family's returned betrothal card.

71
05:07.248 --> 05:08.360
[Betrothal Card]

72
05:08.360 --> 05:11.279
He must respect me, understand me, and accommodate me.

73
05:11.279 --> 05:13.800
He can never pick fights or bully others.

74
05:13.800 --> 05:16.600
Stop. You take me for the wishing turtle at the temple?

75
05:16.600 --> 05:19.639
That turtle there takes money but does nothing.

76
05:19.639 --> 05:22.420
Not like you. You've got good looks and a good heart.

77
05:23.040 --> 05:28.319
Fine, I'll find you some rich fools with money to burn.

78
05:28.319 --> 05:29.819
Very well.

79
05:44.959 --> 05:47.073
Dinner's ready!

80
05:47.073 --> 05:49.392
[Zhao Hai Tang, Concubine of the Jin Family]

81
05:49.392 --> 05:50.399
[Huang Li Rong, Wife of the Jin Family]

82
05:50.399 --> 05:53.560
Bao Zhu, is Yu's egg custard ready?

83
05:53.560 --> 05:55.360
[Jin Bao Yu, Legitimate Son of the Jins] It's ready.

84
05:55.360 --> 05:57.139
Come on, Bao Yu. Sit.

85
06:06.480 --> 06:07.959
Didn't I say no sesame seeds?

86
06:07.959 --> 06:09.600
It hurts my teeth.

87
06:09.600 --> 06:10.920
Stop whining.

88
06:10.920 --> 06:12.540
If you won't eat it, give it to my mama.

89
06:13.360 --> 06:15.639
Hai Tang is sick. Eggs are hard to digest.

90
06:15.639 --> 06:17.639
She should eat light.

91
06:17.639 --> 06:19.879
Yu don't eat the sesame,

92
06:19.879 --> 06:22.240
so just pick them out for him.

93
06:22.240 --> 06:24.279
I cooked the dinner, and now I have to pick the sesame too?

94
06:24.279 --> 06:25.720
How about he eat some leftovers?

95
06:25.720 --> 06:27.120
Outrageous!

96
06:27.120 --> 06:28.480
Such vulgar talk!

97
06:28.480 --> 06:29.639
Fine, don't pick them out.

98
06:29.639 --> 06:31.120
We still need to eat.

99
06:31.120 --> 06:34.680
Mama, you can have it.

100
06:34.680 --> 06:37.040
Bao Zhu, studying strains Yu's eyes,

101
06:37.040 --> 06:38.240
and my eyesight's failing.

102
06:38.240 --> 06:40.079
So I asked for your help.

103
06:40.079 --> 06:43.279
Since my husband passed, you've shouldered the family burden.

104
06:43.279 --> 06:45.240
But once Yu succeeds,

105
06:45.240 --> 06:47.720
you two will enjoy the good life through us.

106
06:47.720 --> 06:50.300
Isn't that right?

107
06:59.920 --> 07:01.879
You're right, Li Rong.

108
07:01.879 --> 07:06.100
The Jin family's future depends on Yu.

109
07:08.720 --> 07:10.920
I'll pick out the part with the sesame.

110
07:10.920 --> 07:13.879
Here, you eat the part with sesame.

111
07:13.879 --> 07:16.160
Yu, you can have the rest.

112
07:16.160 --> 07:18.100
- Here. - You treat me the best after all.

113
07:19.879 --> 07:21.379
Eat up, Yu.

114
07:30.160 --> 07:33.000
Yu studies harder than anyone else,

115
07:33.000 --> 07:34.839
yet he never passes the exams.

116
07:34.839 --> 07:38.360
He was a fusheng scholar in last year's Academy Exam.

117
07:38.360 --> 07:41.199
He told me in private

118
07:41.199 --> 07:43.763
that the rich candidates pulled strings early on

119
07:43.763 --> 07:45.360
and bought the exam questions.

120
07:45.360 --> 07:47.800
I know full well

121
07:47.800 --> 07:50.000
that if Yu can pull it off,

122
07:50.000 --> 07:53.360
Bao Zhu is sure to marry well.

123
07:53.360 --> 07:57.920
It's just that I really don't have any money right now.

124
07:57.920 --> 07:59.420
Hai Tang.

125
08:01.319 --> 08:03.160
Have you heard of the Bai family?

126
08:03.160 --> 08:06.639
They made a fortune in canal shipping.

127
08:06.639 --> 08:09.839
A relative of theirs is Yu's classmate.

128
08:09.839 --> 08:12.639
Hearing Bao Zhu's mourning period is over,

129
08:12.639 --> 08:15.939
he asked Yu to test the waters.

130
08:17.079 --> 08:18.720
That won't do.

131
08:18.720 --> 08:20.879
Even if Bao Zhu marries,

132
08:20.879 --> 08:23.800
she must choose a man she likes.

133
08:23.800 --> 08:26.480
Besides, they are a powerful clan,

134
08:26.480 --> 08:29.079
while we have neither power or money.

135
08:29.079 --> 08:33.639
Even if Bao Zhu married in, she'd probably get pushed around left and right.

136
08:33.639 --> 08:36.720
Bao Zhu loves money most,

137
08:36.720 --> 08:39.120
and the Bais have plenty of it.

138
08:39.120 --> 08:41.480
A few scraps from their table

139
08:41.480 --> 08:44.399
could support us for three years.

140
08:44.399 --> 08:46.320
Yu can take his exams with that money,

141
08:46.320 --> 08:50.759
and once he passes, your daughter will be an official's sister.

142
08:50.759 --> 08:52.960
Then our family will be nobility.

143
08:52.960 --> 08:57.259
However powerful the Bais are, would they dare wrong an official's daughter?

144
08:59.000 --> 09:02.360
This is the Bai family's betrothal agreement.

145
09:02.360 --> 09:03.639
I've already signed it.

146
09:03.639 --> 09:06.000
It just needs your fingerprint as her mama,

147
09:06.000 --> 09:08.940
and it will be settled.

148
09:16.352 --> 09:20.240
Hai Tang, what are you hesitating for?

149
09:20.240 --> 09:24.980
Opportunity only knocks once.

150
09:26.799 --> 09:29.159
No, absolutely not.

151
09:29.159 --> 09:32.840
I have to talk it over with Bao Zhu tomorrow.

152
09:32.840 --> 09:36.019
Anyway, I still have to give her a heads-up.

153
10:03.559 --> 10:05.320
Bao Zhu,

154
10:05.320 --> 10:07.500
be honest with me.

155
10:08.679 --> 10:12.559
Out of all those men, did you really not fancy a single one?

156
10:12.559 --> 10:15.879
Mama, are you really that eager to marry me off?

157
10:15.879 --> 10:17.480
Of course, I'm not.

158
10:17.480 --> 10:21.879
I was just born unlucky into poverty

159
10:21.879 --> 10:23.899
and sold as a concubine.

160
10:25.080 --> 10:27.360
Suffering myself is one thing,

161
10:27.360 --> 10:30.580
but now I can't even protect you.

162
10:31.480 --> 10:33.559
I just want you to marry well

163
10:33.559 --> 10:36.620
so you won't suffer from poverty anymore.

164
10:45.493 --> 10:50.379
Mama, I have money. I can protect you.

165
10:56.080 --> 10:57.559
Look.

166
10:57.559 --> 10:58.679
[Fifty-Four Taels of Silver] Actually,

167
10:58.679 --> 11:00.879
I set my sights on a house a long time ago.

168
11:00.879 --> 11:03.679
It's a bit remote and the rooms are small,

169
11:03.679 --> 11:05.720
but at least it's a place of our own.

170
11:05.720 --> 11:07.080
Give me a few more years.

171
11:07.080 --> 11:10.120
Once I save enough, we'll quietly move there.

172
11:10.120 --> 11:12.799
After we move, we'll have egg custard every day,

173
11:12.799 --> 11:15.200
with dried whitebait,

174
11:15.200 --> 11:17.220
shrimp, and sesame oil.

175
11:32.960 --> 11:34.460
Mama...

176
11:37.519 --> 11:39.080
Rest up, Li Rong.

177
11:39.080 --> 11:40.940
I'm going back to my room.

178
11:43.879 --> 11:47.460
Also, is it true she's been skimming off the top

179
11:48.519 --> 11:50.139
behind our back?

180
11:50.799 --> 11:52.600
What are you saying?

181
11:52.600 --> 11:55.399
Ms. Sai came to arrange matches for Bao Zhu,

182
11:55.399 --> 11:58.440
only to be dragged into the pen to buy meat,

183
11:58.440 --> 12:00.039
making her a fortune.

184
12:00.039 --> 12:01.679
She made the trip for nothing,

185
12:01.679 --> 12:03.799
and only got a pittance.

186
12:03.799 --> 12:06.399
Naturally, she had doubts.

187
12:06.399 --> 12:09.720
Before leaving, she kept an eye out

188
12:09.720 --> 12:11.519
glanced at the door

189
12:11.519 --> 12:16.480
and happened to see Bao Zhu stuffing cash into the soles of her shoes.

190
12:16.480 --> 12:19.399
I raised Bao Zhu myself.

191
12:19.399 --> 12:21.580
She would never do such a thing.

192
12:27.080 --> 12:32.679
From now on, you must act with integrity.

193
12:32.679 --> 12:34.120
Do you understand?

194
12:34.120 --> 12:35.919
Alright, Hai Tang.

195
12:35.919 --> 12:38.879
I think Bao Zhu knows she was wrong.

196
12:38.879 --> 12:40.480
I did nothing wrong!

197
12:40.480 --> 12:43.279
Yes, you did nothing wrong.

198
12:43.279 --> 12:45.879
You act with integrity

199
12:45.879 --> 12:48.200
and never betray your own.

200
12:48.200 --> 12:49.799
I was wrong.

201
12:49.799 --> 12:51.879
It was all my fault.

202
12:51.879 --> 12:53.580
I was too soft

203
12:54.200 --> 12:56.500
and spoiled her rotten!

204
12:57.279 --> 12:58.480
I failed the Jin family!

205
12:58.480 --> 13:02.368
Mama, you're not soft-hearted! You're just foolish!

206
13:02.368 --> 13:05.899
Hey! How dare you talk back!

207
13:08.440 --> 13:11.039
Displeasing parents makes one unfit to be human.

208
13:11.039 --> 13:13.799
Disobeying them makes one unfit to be a child.

209
13:13.799 --> 13:15.559
You dare insult your own mother?

210
13:15.559 --> 13:17.039
Are you even human?

211
13:17.039 --> 13:18.679
Have you no shame, you wretch?

212
13:18.679 --> 13:20.279
Me, a wretch?

213
13:20.279 --> 13:22.200
Then you are the lowest wretch.

214
13:22.200 --> 13:25.240
Yu hangs at the waist, Zhu sits on the crown! (*Yu means jade; Zhu means pearl)

215
13:25.240 --> 13:27.820
I will always stand above you!

216
13:29.440 --> 13:31.399
What kind of "Zhu" can sit on a crown?

217
13:31.399 --> 13:34.720
You illiterate fool, all these years,

218
13:34.720 --> 13:36.360
don't you know the "Zhu" in your name

219
13:36.360 --> 13:37.840
means a pig to be slaughtered?

220
13:37.840 --> 13:40.679
- Then you're worse than a slaughtered pig! - Bao Zhu!

221
13:40.679 --> 13:42.000
If I am a wretch,

222
13:42.000 --> 13:43.559
you are lower than a wretch,

223
13:43.559 --> 13:45.000
- the most pathetic wretch! - Enough!

224
13:45.000 --> 13:46.799
How dare you still talk back?

225
13:46.799 --> 13:48.879
You'd even pocket an egg.

226
13:48.879 --> 13:51.580
Everyone knows you skim every pig deal.

227
13:54.399 --> 13:56.200
If I hadn't pushed you so hard,

228
13:56.200 --> 13:58.159
[Fifty-Four Taels of Silver] it wouldn't have been easy to get this money.

229
13:58.159 --> 13:59.440
Fools are hateful.

230
13:59.440 --> 14:01.600
Those unaware of their folly are pathetic!

231
14:01.600 --> 14:03.720
In the end, you still have to rely on us.

232
14:03.720 --> 14:05.220
Hand over the money!

233
14:10.000 --> 14:11.580
I took the beating.

234
14:12.240 --> 14:15.279
Want the money? Not a chance!

235
14:15.279 --> 14:17.000
You can afford to study

236
14:17.000 --> 14:19.519
only because I butcher and sell pigs every day.

237
14:19.519 --> 14:20.960
I earned this myself,

238
14:20.960 --> 14:22.519
so why should I give it to you?

239
14:22.519 --> 14:24.400
I'm telling you, this is my money!

240
14:24.400 --> 14:25.480
- It's mine! - Bao Zhu!

241
14:25.480 --> 14:26.919
Hai Tang, rein this wild girl!

242
14:26.919 --> 14:29.200
I won't give it to you! It's mine!

243
14:29.200 --> 14:30.779
Enough!

244
14:38.919 --> 14:40.419
Mama.

245
14:41.080 --> 14:42.620
Give it to me.

246
14:45.759 --> 14:47.759
Give the money to Yu,

247
14:47.759 --> 14:49.679
so he can buy connections.

248
14:49.679 --> 14:53.139
You'll only have a good life if he succeeds.

249
14:56.120 --> 14:57.620
Give it to me.

250
14:59.600 --> 15:01.259
Give it here!

251
15:16.559 --> 15:18.399
Concubine Zhao!

252
15:18.399 --> 15:19.480
- Come on, let's get the money. - Hai Tang,

253
15:19.480 --> 15:22.224
- it had to be you. - Let's get the money.

254
15:22.224 --> 15:23.480
Let's go.

255
15:23.480 --> 15:24.980
Slow down.

256
15:55.720 --> 15:58.480
Didn't you always want to be a grand lady?

257
15:58.480 --> 16:02.320
Go on, the Xie family's bridal sedan is waiting at the village entrance,

258
16:02.320 --> 16:03.840
ready for you.

259
16:03.840 --> 16:04.840
What do you know?

260
16:04.840 --> 16:07.759
That sedan's meant for the Xie family's sickly son's bride.

261
16:07.759 --> 16:10.519
Ghost carriers send you to the Underworld, you in?

262
16:10.519 --> 16:11.679
Cut the crap.

263
16:11.679 --> 16:13.360
He's the legitimate son of the Xie family.

264
16:13.360 --> 16:16.860
When he kicks the bucket, all the money will be yours.

265
16:20.120 --> 16:21.200
Here's yours.

266
16:21.200 --> 16:24.279
The son of the Director of the Canal Shipping Bureau

267
16:24.279 --> 16:27.279
topped the provincial examination! Let all rejoice with him!

268
16:27.279 --> 16:29.000
Congratulations!

269
16:29.000 --> 16:31.840
The son of the Director of the Canal Shipping Bureau

270
16:31.840 --> 16:35.379
topped the provincial examination! Let all rejoice with him!

271
16:36.679 --> 16:39.679
The son of the Director of the Canal Shipping Bureau

272
16:39.679 --> 16:42.000
topped the provincial examination!

273
16:42.000 --> 16:43.759
That consumptive jinxes women.

274
16:43.759 --> 16:44.960
Didn't you know?

275
16:44.960 --> 16:46.840
He's a paralytic too.

276
16:46.840 --> 16:49.639
The Huangs burned every bridge to tear up the engagement.

277
16:49.639 --> 16:52.139
No wonder they're here for a woman.

278
17:14.720 --> 17:16.359
- So much money! - Yes.

279
17:16.359 --> 17:18.660
- Shiny silver ingots! - Enough to last us quite a while.

280
17:28.880 --> 17:31.539
Are you insane? Why dress like that?

281
17:34.240 --> 17:36.539
- Yu. - Bao Zhu.

282
17:37.559 --> 17:39.059
Where are you going?

283
18:02.079 --> 18:03.480
Yu, are you alright?

284
18:03.480 --> 18:04.980
It hurts so bad!

285
18:06.519 --> 18:07.920
- Bao Zhu! - Stop her!

286
18:07.920 --> 18:09.759
She's wearing my clothes!

287
18:09.759 --> 18:11.839
People will laugh at us!

288
18:11.839 --> 18:14.359
You fought over eggs and skimmed money, fine.

289
18:14.359 --> 18:16.160
You dare insult your own mother?

290
18:16.160 --> 18:17.400
Are you even human?

291
18:17.400 --> 18:18.880
Have you no shame, you wretch?

292
18:18.880 --> 18:20.079
Me, a wretch?

293
18:20.079 --> 18:22.039
Then you are the lowest wretch.

294
18:22.039 --> 18:24.720
Yu hangs at the waist, Zhu sits on the crown!

295
18:24.720 --> 18:27.220
I will always stand above you!

296
18:31.279 --> 18:32.480
Bao Zhu, you look great!

297
18:32.480 --> 18:34.640
As long as you work hard with my mother,

298
18:34.640 --> 18:36.619
you'll have it easy after marriage.

299
18:38.599 --> 18:40.799
Killing harms your karma.

300
18:40.799 --> 18:44.160
Marry me, and you can leave this lowly trade behind.

301
18:44.160 --> 18:46.019
Vulgar!

302
18:49.400 --> 18:51.200
Bao Zhu, what's wrong?

303
18:51.200 --> 18:52.279
[Lianhua Village] If you marry me,

304
18:52.279 --> 18:54.579
you can just be my pretty wife.

305
19:08.880 --> 19:11.900
Since no one came, let's head back.

306
19:18.400 --> 19:20.059
Wait!

307
19:27.799 --> 19:29.299
Wait!

308
19:32.440 --> 19:33.940
Hold on!

309
19:35.079 --> 19:36.880
You illiterate fool,

310
19:36.880 --> 19:38.440
don't you know the "Zhu" in your name

311
19:38.440 --> 19:41.000
means a pig to be slaughtered?

312
19:41.000 --> 19:43.660
Stop!

313
20:18.640 --> 20:20.140
I, Jin Bao Zhu,

314
20:21.039 --> 20:22.539
will marry him.

315
20:35.520 --> 20:41.047
[Xie Manor]

316
20:53.424 --> 20:55.322
[Zhan Dong Feng, Matriarch of the Xie Family]

317
20:55.322 --> 20:56.839
[Shen Man Yun, Master Rong Chang's Wife]

318
20:56.839 --> 20:57.839
[Qin Ke Han, Master Cheng Zong's Concubine]

319
20:57.839 --> 20:59.339
[Zhou Wan Jun, Madam of the Xie Family, Master Cheng Zong's Wife]

320
21:16.304 --> 21:17.304
[Xie Qiao, Fifth Young Master, Qin Ke Han's Son]

321
21:17.304 --> 21:18.804
[Xie Xi, Third Young Lady, Qin Ke Han's Daughter]

322
21:26.759 --> 21:29.240
M-Matriarch,

323
21:29.240 --> 21:32.720
Master Yan says he is indisposed today

324
21:32.720 --> 21:34.279
[Jian Wei, Page of the Xie Family] and has trouble walking,

325
21:34.279 --> 21:37.819
so this rooster will take his place for the bows.

326
21:47.200 --> 21:48.779
Rise.

327
21:49.759 --> 21:52.440
Poor thing.

328
21:52.440 --> 21:55.480
What a ridiculous stunt that unfilial boy pulled,

329
21:55.480 --> 21:58.440
making you endure this fright.

330
21:58.440 --> 22:00.519
Take some candied fruit and go back.

331
22:00.519 --> 22:02.059
Thank you, Matriarch.

332
22:07.559 --> 22:09.460
First bow to Heaven and Earth!

333
22:15.680 --> 22:17.579
Second bow to the parents!

334
22:30.480 --> 22:32.500
Bows to each other!

335
22:46.079 --> 22:49.539
Lady Jin.

336
22:51.240 --> 22:52.740
Lady Jin.

337
23:23.319 --> 23:24.559
Lady Jin,

338
23:24.559 --> 23:27.240
this Beiyuan tea arrived just last month.

339
23:27.240 --> 23:28.920
It's not the tribute grade.

340
23:28.920 --> 23:31.900
It's for the nobles to rinse their mouths with.

341
23:32.880 --> 23:36.779
If you are thirsty, I'll have someone brew fine tea for you.

342
23:37.960 --> 23:39.480
That explains it.

343
23:39.480 --> 23:41.740
Who drinks tea so late at night?

344
23:44.880 --> 23:47.559
Where is your... my young master?

345
23:47.559 --> 23:49.440
As for the master's private affairs,

346
23:49.440 --> 23:53.559
I do not know, nor would I dare speak out of turn.

347
23:53.559 --> 23:56.599
Wait, so I'm just supposed to sit here waiting

348
23:56.599 --> 23:58.380
on our wedding night?

349
24:04.440 --> 24:06.579
Understood. You may leave.

350
24:16.240 --> 24:17.680
Ming Pei,

351
24:17.680 --> 24:20.200
Master Yan went to Shuyu Pavilion early for music.

352
24:20.200 --> 24:22.920
You knew it all along, so why didn't you tell her?

353
24:22.920 --> 24:24.880
It's getting windy.

354
24:24.880 --> 24:27.960
Those who stay perched are falcons,

355
24:27.960 --> 24:31.299
while those who fall are mere sparrows.

356
24:46.720 --> 24:49.880
The dancers are quite something today!

357
24:49.880 --> 24:51.640
- Bottoms up! - Bottoms up!

358
24:51.640 --> 24:53.140
Come on.

359
24:57.240 --> 24:59.079
- Come on! - Come on, fill it up!

360
24:59.079 --> 25:02.000
Let's raise a cup to Cheng Jiang!

361
25:02.000 --> 25:03.500
- Come on! - Bottoms up!

362
25:04.680 --> 25:06.692
Drink more.

363
25:06.692 --> 25:09.039
- Empty the cup! - Beautiful dancing!

364
25:09.039 --> 25:11.400
Reward them later!

365
25:11.400 --> 25:13.519
I don't know what his family was thinking,

366
25:13.519 --> 25:15.680
forcing him to marry a country bumpkin.

367
25:15.680 --> 25:19.180
A butcher's daughter must be utterly vulgar.

368
25:36.799 --> 25:39.859
Who is Xie Yan?

369
25:53.880 --> 25:57.619
A dressed-up monkey indeed.

370
25:58.440 --> 25:59.940
What's wrong with a monkey?

371
26:04.400 --> 26:05.720
[Lu Zi Yu] He's mocking you.

372
26:05.720 --> 26:07.740
[Son of Yangzhou Prefecture River Sub-Prefect] He's calling you an ape in human clothes.

373
26:08.799 --> 26:11.920
Tell me, aren't you scared he'll jinx you to death

374
26:11.920 --> 26:14.019
if you stay with him?

375
26:16.559 --> 26:20.180
Believe it or not, one cut from me, and you'll die before me.

376
26:22.279 --> 26:25.440
Greasy and painted, utterly vulgar.

377
26:25.440 --> 26:27.880
Rude, arrogant fool,

378
26:27.880 --> 26:29.500
you bookish pig!

379
26:33.279 --> 26:35.519
I heard the eldest son of the Xie family

380
26:35.519 --> 26:39.160
is a jinxed invalid and a paralytic.

381
26:39.160 --> 26:40.480
Engagement called off,

382
26:40.480 --> 26:42.960
he had to take a concubine from the countryside.

383
26:42.960 --> 26:44.460
Is that right?

384
26:47.680 --> 26:50.160
Silence means yes.

385
26:50.160 --> 26:53.000
Alright, are you going back on your own,

386
26:53.000 --> 26:54.859
or do I have to tie you up?

387
27:11.400 --> 27:13.759
I wanted to live in peace with you,

388
27:13.759 --> 27:16.259
but now, I've changed my mind.

389
27:21.599 --> 27:23.099
Well...

390
27:28.920 --> 27:30.420
Put me down!

391
27:33.359 --> 27:34.940
Let me down!

392
27:36.000 --> 27:37.660
Let me down!

393
27:38.599 --> 27:40.099
You shrew!

394
27:41.559 --> 27:43.380
You crazy shrew!

395
27:44.519 --> 27:46.259
Put me down!

396
27:47.079 --> 27:48.579
You...

397
27:52.432 --> 27:55.460
[Virtue and Integrity]

398
28:04.640 --> 28:07.680
Mother, I heard

399
28:07.680 --> 28:11.000
that girl is renowned for miles around for her competence.

400
28:11.000 --> 28:12.680
She could support Yan.

401
28:12.680 --> 28:16.960
Besides, pedigree matters little when taking a concubine,

402
28:16.960 --> 28:20.200
which is why the Master and I agreed to it.

403
28:20.200 --> 28:22.259
Yan agreed as well?

404
28:23.799 --> 28:28.640
Back then, the Huangs were eager to arrange a betrothal,

405
28:28.640 --> 28:31.504
and the Master went to great lengths

406
28:31.504 --> 28:35.119
to convince Yan to accept it.

407
28:35.119 --> 28:36.619
Later...

408
28:39.359 --> 28:44.240
Later, that terrible accident happened,

409
28:44.240 --> 28:47.279
and they rushed to break off the match.

410
28:47.279 --> 28:50.960
Not only that, they spread rumors all over town,

411
28:50.960 --> 28:53.559
leaving everyone whispering behind our backs

412
28:53.559 --> 28:57.440
that Yan is a sickly jinx who curses wives,

413
28:57.440 --> 28:59.839
forcing us to cancel the betrothal.

414
28:59.839 --> 29:03.720
None of us could swallow that insult,

415
29:03.720 --> 29:05.519
let alone Yan.

416
29:05.519 --> 29:08.680
So Yan doesn't care for her,

417
29:08.680 --> 29:12.819
and only agreed to spite them?

418
29:13.960 --> 29:15.400
How foolish!

419
29:15.400 --> 29:19.359
Saving face is not about a moment, but a lifetime.

420
29:19.359 --> 29:23.180
Don't you understand that harmony in the family brings prosperity?

421
29:25.720 --> 29:28.079
You are right, Mother.

422
29:28.079 --> 29:30.880
In my rush to vindicate our pride,

423
29:30.880 --> 29:32.559
I wronged Yan.

424
29:32.559 --> 29:33.839
It was all my fault.

425
29:33.839 --> 29:35.680
You arranged a mismatched marriage,

426
29:35.680 --> 29:38.079
wronging the children of both families,

427
29:38.079 --> 29:40.299
not just Yan.

428
29:44.240 --> 29:46.519
Matriarch, Madam,

429
29:46.519 --> 29:49.500
Lady Jin carried Master Yan all the way back

430
29:50.519 --> 29:53.660
from Shuyu Pavilion on... on her shoulders.

431
29:55.400 --> 29:57.460
Carried him on her shoulders?

432
30:04.440 --> 30:05.480
Bring her here.

433
30:05.480 --> 30:06.980
I'm not deaf.

434
30:09.240 --> 30:11.940
Why glare at me? Do I owe you money?

435
30:13.519 --> 30:14.880
Come here and sign.

436
30:14.880 --> 30:16.784
Sign what?

437
30:16.784 --> 30:18.000
[Concubine Release Deed]

438
30:18.000 --> 30:19.500
Concubine Release Deed.

439
30:21.079 --> 30:22.880
I can't read or write.

440
30:22.880 --> 30:25.119
Vulgar and unrefined,

441
30:25.119 --> 30:27.200
bent only on social climbing,

442
30:27.200 --> 30:29.420
so naturally, no time for books.

443
30:33.519 --> 30:35.019
Right, Jian Wei?

444
30:41.200 --> 30:42.900
I can sign.

445
30:44.000 --> 30:47.339
Just have everyone else step outside.

446
30:55.759 --> 30:57.259
Just a signature...

447
31:14.279 --> 31:16.000
You dared slap me?

448
31:16.000 --> 31:17.779
Yes, I did!
